              "solution": "The statement ∀xP(x) is the same as the conjunction P(1)∧P(2)∧P(3)∧P(4), because the domain consists of the integers 1, 2, 3, and 4. BecauseP(4), which is the statement “4 2 < 10,” is false, it follows that∀xP(x) is false. ◂",
