              "kind": "text",
              "section": "1.5",
              "subsection": "1.5.2",
              "rawText": "To understand statements involving nested quantiﬁers, we need to unravel what the quantiﬁers\nand predicates that appear mean. This is illustrated in Examples 1 and 2.",
              "text": "To understand statements involving nested quantifiers, we need to unravel what the quantifiers and predicates that appear mean. This is illustrated in Examples 1 and 2.",
