              "section": "1.5",
              "subsection": "1.5.5",
              "rawText": "Expressions with nested quantiﬁers expressing statements in English can be quite complicated.\nThe ﬁrst step in translating such an expression is to write out what the quantiﬁers and predicates\nin the expression mean. The next step is to express this meaning in a simpler sentence. This\nprocess is illustrated in Examples 9 and 10.",
